  "review_notes": [
    "The ASV reorders the final clauses ('how will he then vex himself, if we tell him…'): 'how' goes to אֵיךְ, 'then' to the waw of וְעָשָׂה, 'if' to the waw of וְאֵיךְ (the connective the ASV wrote for that clause, rule 55), and 'that' over the asyndetic speech clause is added.",
    "Marginal alternative rendering read and set aside.",
    "Reconciliation: 'if' moved from an added unit onto the clause's waw s041; nothing else changed."
  ]
